=====================================
        MINI-MAP GUIDE
=====================================


::MINI-MAP BASICS::
-------------------------------------
Toggle: Click "Mini-Map" button.
Layout: Maps as yellow squares in grid.
Footer: RND (randomize), Refresh, Cancel, X.
Squares: Represent map tabs; green border on current.


::DOTS & OPENINGS::
-------------------------------------
7 Dots/Square: Positions T/R/B/L/IL/IC/IR.
Colors:
  - Black: Default opening.
  - Orange: Waypoint (5).
  - Green: Connected.
Openings Code: 7 chars (0-5); sets dot types.


::CONNECTIONS::
-------------------------------------
Lines: Between dots; colors by type (black/gold/green/red/blue).
Compatibility: Per door.guide; waypoints (5) to 0/4/5.
Waypoint Rules:
  - 'Q' Home: Many instance connects.
  - 'I' Instance: 1 connect (home/instance).
Randomize: Linear random between maps if compatible.


::INTERACTIONS::
-------------------------------------
Left-Click Dot: Select (blue); click another to connect/disconnect.
Right-Click Dot: Deconnect.
Hover Dot: Red self; cyan compatibles; red lines.
Right-Click Square: Switch to map tab.
Refresh: Regenerate layout.


::NOTES::
-------------------------------------
- Connections saved in .mapd (;connections::).
- Use with openings/symbols ('Q'/'I') for teleporters.
- Validate per rules; no invalid lines.

=====================================
  Visualize & connect maps easily.
=====================================
